+id: task-002-implement-json-patch-applypatch-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Patch applyPatch (RFC 6902)"
+status: pending
+---
+
+## What was done
+
+Added `applyPatch(document, patch)` and the `PatchOperation` type in `src/index.ts`, implementing JSON
+Patch (RFC 6902) with `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy` and `test`. It builds on the pointer
+parsing of `resolvePointer`. Tests were written first in `src/index.test.ts` (run with `npm test`):
+the RFC 6902 appendix A examples, error paths, non-mutation, atomicity, prototype safety and patch
+validation. See dl-002 for the semantics chosen.
